## BACKEND

### Process Manager

* Spawn via node-pty

* Maintain Map<serverId, PTY>

* Methods:

  * start
  * stop (send `QUIT`, fallback SIGTERM)
  * kill (SIGKILL)
  * restart
  * sendCommand

* On crash:

  * auto-restart (if enabled)
  * log event

---

### Console Handling

* Strip ANSI
* Broadcast lines
* Store last 500 lines
* Emit to subscribers

---

### Log Parsing

Parse patterns:

* PlayerEntered → join
* PlayerLeft → leave
* Kill → kill
* Chat → chat
* Ban/Kick → moderation
* New round → round_start

Emit structured events.

---

### Config Parser

* parse(): string → object
* serialize(): object → string
* Preserve multi-word values
* Sort keys
* Atomic writes

---

### Metrics Collector

Every 5s:

* pidusage → cpu/memory
* player count (from state)
* insert into DB
* broadcast WS

Prune >7 days

---

### Server Query

* UDP ping server
* Extract:

  * player count
  * name
  * map
* Timeout: 3s

---

### Master Query

* Try UDP (multiple masters)
* Fallback: scrape stats site
* Return normalized server list
* Cache 30s

